sequenceDiagram
  actor PI as Researcher
  participant PR as researcher-profile.html
  participant PM as ProfileManager
  participant PN as proposal-new.html
  participant DP as DocxParser (client-side)
  PI->>PR: Fill RS-01 Part B once, click "บันทึกโปรไฟล์"
  PR->>PM: saveProfile()
  PI->>PN: Create proposal
  PN->>PM: getProfile()
  PM-->>PN: profile data
  PN-->>PI: auto-fill contact and team fields
  PI->>PN: Drop RS-01 .docx in dropzone
  PN->>DP: extractRS01(file)
  alt valid layout
    DP-->>PN: Title, Abstract, Objectives, Methodology
    PN-->>PI: preview panel, fill form fields
  else corrupt or unknown layout
    DP-->>PN: parse error
    PN-->>PI: warning, continue with manual entry
  end
